Subject: Preserve Wii noise wrapping and validate native camera filter inputs

Upstream-base: 0f5a757947b8778b680d4d1ae7e6df1792a514f2

Use defined 32-bit modular noise arithmetic and bounded float-to-index
conversion on native hosts. Initialize inactive noise displacement. Retain the
original rumble state gating and clamped integration step with an actual task
manager; reject invalid timing and non-finite filter requests explicitly.

